'''Dead by Encore''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] and appears on the 3rd, 4th, 17th, and 18th days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Parade of the Dead (Deadly)|Dead on Debut]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first cleared, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Curling Cat]], Green Shell Cat.

